    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Management API allows businesses to enhance their online shopping experience by facilitating the addition of items to customer shopping carts. This endpoint enables consumers to submit product selections, providing a seamless way to manage potential purchases. Typical users include e-commerce platforms and developers looking to integrate dynamic cart functionalities into their applications. The API ensures that items are efficiently added to the cart, thereby streamlining the shopping process for end-users.",
